  "title": "packet-knxip: remove redundant null pinfo check",
  "description": "The checks for non-null `pinfo` in `dissect_crd()` make Coverity believe\nthe function can be called with `pinfo == NULL`. (CID 1664944)\nThat can never happen, so remove those checks to give the tool one less\nthing to worry about.",
